    "detailed_description": "&quot;Horror Family - Flight&quot; is a loop-based horror game set on an airplane and is the first installment in the Horror Family series.<br><br><strong>Story</strong>: The protagonist (Mitsuo Nakamura) falls asleep on a plane on his way back from a business trip.<br>And when he wakes up...<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong>: This game is a loop-based horror game.<br><br><strong>Immersion</strong>: The game screen flickers with noise, intensifying the horror.<br><br><strong>Play Time</strong>: It can be completed in about 20 minutes.<br><br><strong>Developer's Anecdote</strong>: Developed single-handedly by a 15-year-old.<br><br><strong>Notice</strong>:The title has been changed from \u201cGrudge Murder\u201d to \u201cHorror Family\u201d.<br><br><strong>Video Distribution Guidelines</strong>:<br>Individuals and corporations alike are free to post, broadcast, and monetize on social media and other platforms without prior notice. However, since we have used the service &quot;Ondoku-san&quot; for the voice readings in the game, due to copyright reasons, please either display the end credits in the video or, if that is not possible,please credit &quot;\u00a9 in the description section of social media and video posting sites.<br>Also, please understand that we cannot be held responsible for any damages arising from the distribution of videos of this game.<br>The contents of this guideline are subject to change without notice.<br><br><strong>Credit notation-Music used in PV</strong><br>\u25cf\u30b5\u30a4\u30c8\u540d\u21d2 \u7518\u8336\u306e\u97f3\u697d\u5de5\u623f\uff08English\uff1dMusic Atelier Amacha\uff09",
